      '#withAvailabilityType':: d.fn(help="\"'Availability type of an Instance. Defaults to REGIONAL for both primary and read instances.\\nNote that primary and read instances can have different availability types.\\nOnly READ_POOL instance supports ZONAL type. Users can't specify the zone for READ_POOL instance.\\nZone is automatically chosen from the list of zones in the region specified.\\nRead pool of size 1 can only have zonal availability. Read pools with node count of 2 or more\\ncan have regional availability (nodes are present in 2 or more zones in a region).'\\nPossible values are: AVAILABILITY_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED, ZONAL, REGIONAL.\"", args=[d.arg(name='availabilityType', type=d.T.string)]),
